## Phase 0: Read the ticket

The ticket, its comment thread, and its screenshots are embedded above — read them; do not re-fetch. Read **every** comment and **Read every referenced screenshot path**, looking for:
- **Devin AI analysis** blocks (structured "Root Cause / Proposed Fix / Affected Files").
- **Canary-Agent triage comment** — usually contains hotel admin links, **hotel slug**, **account UUID**, log links, and the routed team. Goldmine for entities. (Its log links may point to Datadog — that's **deprecated**; pull the same data from Groundcover instead.)
- Team follow-ups, repro steps, and links to Sentry or Groundcover.

Extract: title, description, state, priority, assignee, labels, project, SLA. If you genuinely need something the embed doesn't carry (a related issue, a linked document), fetch it **read-only** via the Linear MCP.

